 предложение.","sub":"","before":"Are you free","after":"evening?","answers":["this"],"bank":["this","at","in"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Слова","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Would you like to","after":"us?","answers":["join"],"bank":["invite","join","meet me"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два приглашения.","sub":"Одно — по-дружески, другое — вежливо.","items":[{"text":"Let's go to the cinema.","src":"/learning/audio/a0/b445eb75b6d8.mp3"},{"text":"Would you like to join us?","src":"/learning/audio/a0/a20615f87cc0.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Три способа пригласить","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Форма</th><th>Пример</th><th>Стиль</th></tr><tr><td>Let's + verb</td><td>Let's go to the café.</td><td>friends, easy</td></tr><tr><td>Do you want to…?</td><td>Do you want to meet at six?</td><td>friends</td></tr><tr><td>Would you like to…?</td><td>Would you like to join us?</td><td>polite</td></tr></table><p>После <b>Let's</b> глагол без изменений: Let's <b>go</b>.</p><p>После <b>want</b> и <b>would like</b> — <b>to</b> + глагол.</p><p>Согласие: <b>Sounds good.</b> Отказ: <b>Sorry, I can't.</b></p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"me, you, him, her, us, them","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Форма</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>me</td><td>Call me after work.</td></tr><tr><td>he</td><td>him</td><td>I know him.</td></tr><tr><td>she</td><td>her</td><td>Ask her.</td></tr><tr><td>we</td><td>us</td><td>Come with us.</td></tr><tr><td>they</td><td>them</td><td>I love them.</td></tr></table><p>Эти слова стоят <b>после</b> глагола или после with / for.</p><p>Call <b>me</b>, а не «call I». Come with <b>us</b>, а не «with we».</p><p>Запоминайте целыми чанками: call me, with us, ask her.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">you и it одинаковы в обеих ролях.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Let's go to the cinema.","Do you want to meet at six?","Would you like to join us?","Sounds good!","Sorry, I can't. I'm busy.","Call me after work."]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"Let's ___ to the cinema.","options":["to go","going","go"],"keep":false,"answer":"go","why":"После Let's глагол без to.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"Do you want ___ meet at six?","options":["to","for","–"],"keep":false,"answer":"to","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"Call ___ after work.","options":["I","me","my"],"keep":false,"answer":"me","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Come with","after":"!","answers":["us"],"bank":["our","us","we"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I know","after":". He's my neighbour.","answers":["him"],"bank":["him","he","his"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Ask","after":". She has the tickets.","answers":["her"],"bank":["hers","her","she"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Let's go to the cinema this evening.","options":["Sounds good!","Yes, I am.","I like."],"keep":false,"answer":"Sounds good!","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Do you want to meet on Saturday?","options":["No, I don't want.","Sorry, I can't. I'm busy.","No, thanks, I'm not."],"keep":false,"answer":"Sorry, I can't. I'm busy.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Would you like to join us?","options":["Yes, I'd like to. Thanks!","Yes, I would like.","Yes, I do it."],"keep":false,"answer":"Yes, I'd like to. Thanks!","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"cols","title":"Согласие или отказ?","sub":"","columns":["Согласие","Отказ"],"items":[{"text":"Yes, I'd like to.","col":0},{"text":"Maybe another day.","col":1},{"text":"Sorry, I can't.","col":1},{"text":"That's a good idea.","col":0},{"text":"I'm busy this evening.","col":1},{"text":"Sounds good!","col":0}]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["meet","at","Let's","six","o'clock."],"answer":"Let's meet at six o'clock.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["to","the","you","cinema?","want","go","Do","to"],"answer":"Do you want to go to the cinema?","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["like","to","Would","us?","join","you"],"answer":"Would you like to join us?","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Let's","to","go","to","the","café."],"bad":1,"answer":"Let's go to the café.","why":"После Let's нет to."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Come","with","we!"],"bad":2,"answer":"Come with us!","why":"После with — us."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Do","you","want","meet","at","six?"],"bad":3,"answer":"Do you want to meet at six?","why":"После want — to + глагол."},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/02a2ec0971e4.mp3","prompt":"— Where would you like to go?","options":["To the cinema.","I don't know. You?","At six o'clock."],"answer":"I don't know. You?","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/02a2ec0971e4.mp3","before":"There's a café next to the","after":".","answers":["school"],"bank":["school","cinema","station"]},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/02a2ec0971e4.mp3","prompt":"Как отвечает собеседник?","options":["Sorry, I can't.","OK, that's a good idea.","I'm busy."],"answer":"OK, that's a good idea.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/3fed18bca8d1.mp3","prompt":"Что вы слышите?","options":["He watched us.","He watched them.","We watched him."],"answer":"He watched us.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/08dbba889362.mp3","before":"She likes","after":".","answers":["us"],"bank":["us","him","them"]},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/9a1d68e886f0.mp3","prompt":"Что вы слышите?","options":["They looked at me.","They looked at us.","They looked at him."],"answer":"They looked at us.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/eeea04f648ba.mp3","prompt":"Какое приглашение звучит?","options":["dinner","the cinema","a coffee"],"answer":"dinner","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/eeea04f648ba.mp3","prompt":"Человек соглашается?","options":["Yes, with a condition.","No, never.","We don't know."],"answer":"Yes, with a condition.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте сообщение Даны.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dana</p><p>Hi! I'm Dana. It's Friday and I'm free this evening.</p><p>Let's go to the cinema! There's a new film.</p><p>Call me after work and come with us.</p><p>Sorry, I can't on Saturday — I'm busy. Sunday is good.</p>"},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Dana is free this evening.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dana</p><p>Hi! I'm Dana. It's Friday and I'm free this evening.</p><p>Let's go to the cinema! There's a new film.</p><p>Call me after work and come with us.</p><p>Sorry, I can't on Saturday — I'm busy. Sunday is good.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Dana is free on Saturday.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dana</p><p>Hi! I'm Dana. It's Friday and I'm free this evening.</p><p>Let's go to the cinema! There's a new film.</p><p>Call me after work and come with us.</p><p>Sorry, I can't on Saturday — I'm busy. Sunday is good.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Call","after":"after work.","answers":["me"],"bank":["me","I","my"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dana</p><p>Hi! I'm Dana. It's Friday and I'm free this evening.</p><p>Let's go to the cinema! There's a new film.</p><p>Call me after work and come with us.</p><p>Sorry, I can't on Saturday — I'm busy. Sunday is good.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"write","title":"Напишите приглашение.","sub":"Пригласите друга и укажите время.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>Let's ___ !</li><li>Do you want to ___ ?</li><li>Call ___ this evening.</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Let's</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Do you want to</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Would you like to</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">go to the cinema</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">meet at six</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">join us</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">me</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">us</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">tomorrow</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>После <b>Let's</b> у глагола нет <b>to</b>.</li><li>После <b>want to</b> глагол без изменений.</li><li>Я использовал(а) <b>me</b> или <b>us</b>, а не <b>I</b>/<b>we</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Приглашение звучит тепло, а не ровно.","items":["Let's go to the cinema!","Do you want to meet at six?","Sounds good!","Sorry, I can't. I'm busy."],"itemAudio":["/learning/audio/a0/8685bc0bfec4.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/7377893edc53.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/0f7c848dc6cf.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/de2b728c3afe.mp3"]},{"stage":"Итоги","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 22 пройден","sub":"Урок 22 из 24 · Юнит 6 пройден","items":["Я могу пригласить кого-то.","Я могу принять приглашение.","Я могу вежливо отказать."]}]}
